\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/animal/owl/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Owl\\\",\\\" Name Generator\\\"]}],\\\", the calculating \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",\\\"72\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/animal/cat/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Cat\\\",\\\" Name Generator\\\"]}],\\\", the problem-solving \\\",\\\"$L23\\\",\\\", the curious \\\",\\\"$L24\\\",\\\". A name that means wisdom honors your pet's mental gifts and celebrates their thoughtful nature. This guide explores wisdom-names from ancient philosophy to modern literature.\\\"]}],\\\"$L25\\\",\\\"$L26\\\",\\\"$L27\\\",\\\"$L28\\\",\\\"$L29\\\",\\\"$L2a\\\",\\\"$L2b\\\",\\\"$L2c\\\",\\\"$L2d\\\",\\\"$L2e\\\",\\\"$L2f\\\",\\\"$L30\\\"]}],\\\"$L31\\\",\\\"$L32\\\",\\\"$L33\\\",\\\"$L34\\\",\\\"$L35\\\",\\\"$L36\\\"]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"23:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",\\\"99\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/animal/dog/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Dog\\\",\\\" Name Generator\\\"]}]\\n24:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",\\\"118\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/animal/parrot/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Parrot\\\",\\\" Name Generator\\\"]}]\\n25:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Classical Wisdom Names 🏛️\\\"]}]\\n26:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"The ancient world gave us timeless wisdom names. \\u003cstrong\\u003eAthena\\u003c/strong\\u003e, Greek goddess of wisdom, is the ultimate smart-pet name. \\u003cstrong\\u003eMinerva\\u003c/strong\\u003e, her Roman counterpart, offers similar gravitas. \\u003cstrong\\u003eSophia\\u003c/strong\\u003e, the Greek word for wisdom itself, has been cherished for millennia. \\u003cstrong\\u003eSolomon\\u003c/strong\\u003e, the biblical king known for his wisdom, makes a dignified name for a calm, intelligent pet.\\\"}}]\\n27:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"Other classical wisdom names: \\u003cstrong\\u003eSage\\u003c/strong\\u003e (wise one), \\u003cstrong\\u003eThoth\\u003c/strong\\u003e (Egyptian god of wisdom), \\u003cstrong\\u003eOdin\\u003c/strong\\u003e (Norse god who sacrificed an eye for wisdom), \\u003cstrong\\u003eMimir\\u003c/strong\\u003e (Norse being of knowledge). The name \\u003cstrong\\u003ePlato\\u003c/strong\\u003e brings philosophical gravitas, while \\u003cstrong\\u003eOracle\\u003c/strong\\u003e suggests prophetic knowing.\\\"}}]\\n28:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"5\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Literary \\u0026 Philosophical Names 📚\\\"]}]\\n29:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"6\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"Literature and philosophy give us some of the wisest-sounding names. \\u003cstrong\\u003eGandalf\\u003c/strong\\u003e (wise wizard), \\u003cstrong\\u003eDumbledore\\u003c/strong\\u003e (headmaster of wisdom), \\u003cstrong\\u003eYoda\\u003c/strong\\u003e (Jedi master of wisdom), \\u003cstrong\\u003eAtticus\\u003c/strong\\u003e (wise father in To Kill a Mockingbird). \\u003cstrong\\u003eMerlin\\u003c/strong\\u003e, the legendary wizard, embodies magical wisdom.\\\"}}]\\n2a:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"7\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"Philosophical names: \\u003cstrong\\u003eBuddha\\u003c/strong\\u003e (enlightened one), \\u003cstrong\\u003eLao\\u003c/strong\\u003e (after Lao Tzu), \\u003cstrong\\u003eRumi\\u003c/strong\\u003e (wise poet), \\u003cstrong\\u003eSeneca\\u003c/strong\\u003e (Stoic philosopher). \\u003cstrong\\u003eNewton\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eEinstein\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eCurie\\u003c/strong\\u003e, and \\u003cstrong\\u003eHawking\\u003c/strong\\u003e honor scientific genius. \\u003cstrong\\u003eTuring\\u003c/strong\\u003e, the father of computing, makes a wonderfully unique wise name.\\\"}}]\\n2b:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"8\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Nature's Wise Names 🌿\\\"]}]\\n2c:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"9\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"Nature provides its own symbols of wisdom. \\u003cstrong\\u003eOwl\\u003c/strong\\u003e is the universal symbol of wisdom — perfect for a bird or any pet with knowing eyes. Trees, ancient and patient, offer \\u003cstrong\\u003eOak\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eElder\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eSequoia\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eBanyan\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eBodhi\\u003c/strong\\u003e (the tree of enlightenment).\\\"}}]\\n2d:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"10\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"Mountains evoke eternal wisdom: \\u003cstrong\\u003eEverest\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eDenali\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eFuji\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eOlympus\\u003c/strong\\u003e. The moon, silent and knowing, inspires \\u003cstrong\\u003eLuna\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eSelene\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eChandra\\u003c/strong\\u003e. Elephants, renowned for their memory and wisdom, suggest \\u003cstrong\\u003eGanesha\\u003c/strong\\u003e (Hindu god of wisdom), \\u003cstrong\\u003eHathi\\u003c/strong\\u003e, \\u003cstrong\\u003eBabar\\u003c/strong\\u003e.\\\"}}]\\n2e:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"11\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Global Wisdom Names 🌍\\\"]}]\\n2f:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"12\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"Languages around the world offer beautiful wisdom names. Japanese: \\u003cstrong\\u003eChie\\u003c/strong\\u003e (wisdom), \\u003cstrong\\u003eSatoshi\\u003c/strong\\u003e (wise, clear-thinking), \\u003cstrong\\u003eKenji\\u003c/strong\\u003e (wise, intelligent). Chinese: \\u003cstrong\\u003eZhi\\u003c/strong\\u003e (wisdom), \\u003cstrong\\u003eMing\\u003c/strong\\u003e (bright, wise). Sanskrit: \\u003cstrong\\u003eBodhi\\u003c/strong\\u003e (awakening, enlightenment),\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\" \\u003cstrong\\u003ePrajna\\u003c/strong\\u003e (wisdom), \\u003cstrong\\u003eVeda\\u003c/strong\\u003e (knowledge).\\\"}}]\\n30:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"13\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"Celtic wisdom: \\u003cstrong\\u003eFionn\\u003c/strong\\u003e (fair, wise), \\u003cstrong\\u003eSenan\\u003c/strong\\u003e (little wise one). Arabic: \\u003cstrong\\u003eHakeem\\u003c/strong\\u003e (wise), \\u003cstrong\\u003eRashid\\u003c/strong\\u003e (rightly guided). Hebrew: \\u003cstrong\\u003eChochma\\u003c/strong\\u003e (wisdom). Native American: \\u003cstrong\\u003eNokomis\\u003c/strong\\u003e (grandmother, wise woman). African: \\u003cstrong\\u003eAkili\\u003c/strong\\u003e (wisdom, intelligence in Swahili), \\u003cstrong\\u003eZuri\\u003c/strong\\u003e (beautiful and wise).\\\"}}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"31:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-12 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"❓ Frequently Asked Questions\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"space-y-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"details\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"summary\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"How do I know if a wisdom name suits my pet?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Watch your pet's behavior — animals who pause to observe, solve puzzles, learn quickly, or seem to 'think' before acting suit wisdom names perfectly. But any beloved pet deserves a name you find meaningful.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"details\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"summary\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Are wisdom names too serious for playful pets?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Not at all! The contrast between a playful pet and a profound name like Socrates or Bodhi creates wonderful character. A silly dog named Plato is both endearing and memorable.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"details\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"summary\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"What's the most popular wisdom-inspired pet name?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Athena and Sage are currently the most popular wisdom names for pets globally. Both are short, beautiful to say, and carry clear meaning without being overly serious.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"details\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"summary\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Can I use a philosopher's name even if I haven't read their work?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The name itself carries cultural weight and meaning. You don't need to be a philosophy scholar to appreciate the wisdom association of names like Plato or Rumi. What matters is how the name feels to you.\\\"}]]}]]}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"32:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-12\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"🐾 Related Animal Name Generators\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",\\\"owl\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/animal/owl/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl mb-1\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"🦉\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Owl\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",\\\"elephant\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/animal/elephant/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl mb-1\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"🐘\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Elephant\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",\\\"cat\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/ani